      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "If the shape was created with the [`init(geometry:options:)`](scnphysicsshape/init(geometry:options:).md) method, the source object is an [`SCNGeometry`](scngeometry.md) object, and the [`options`](scnphysicsshape/options.md) property contains the options affecting the shape’s construction from that geometry.",
